(text "Device coordinates and placement: design.py. Pin map: SPEC.md 5.3.\nJ4 polarity: pin 2 = +, pin 1 = -, silkscreen + and - beside the pads.\nQ2 reverse-battery PMOS, Q3 load sharing (off while VBUS is present), D1 VBUS to VSYS.\nU2 VDD5 from VBUS, VIO from 3V3 (WCH dual-supply scheme): no battery current, no back-feed.\nSD pull-ups go to 3V3_PERIPH; SD_CD pull-up goes to 3V3 (GPIO15 is a strapping pin).\nE1 electrodes: copper zones on L4 (B.Cu) drawn by build_pcb.py; E1 pads are their plated connections." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 400 330 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b781bc76-0b78-587d-93f1-2196b1b09483"))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
